  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "The Squad is mapped to the Gang of Four",
  "description": "The textual element 'the squad?' is juxtaposed with the visual material of the four women, implying that the group of women visually represented is being referred to as 'The Squad'. The subsequent text 'more like \"the gang of four!\"' rebrands the same visual group with a pejorative term, creating an analogical mapping where the visual group (the four women) is mapped onto the textual concept 'the gang of four'. This mapping is central to the meme's intent to delegitimize the political group by rebranding it with a dismissive label.",
